A Higher Kind is an umbrella term for the beings first born from the primordial singularity at the start of time. Higher Kinds formed before the [[Geography/Astra|Astra]] was stable enough to form local [[Phenomena/Weave|Weaves]], so they're tied directly to the underlying [[Phenomena/Aetheric Field|Aetheric Field]].
